[2026-05-30T18:05:24.692Z] [INFO] {"body":"Fixes #358.\n\n## Summary\n- Removed the Rust hard-coded program-modifier allowlist; write_program now discovers modifier slugs from program-plan rules and recognizes their natural-language triggers through operation-vocabulary seed data.\n- Added reverse-sort file-listing task variants and templates, including the composed path_argument + reverse_sort task.\n- Mirrored the rule set in the web worker and expanded the JS parity experiment.\n- Covered explicit and follow-up reverse-sort behavior in English, Russian, Hindi, and Chinese.\n\n## Reproduction\nBefore this change, `cargo test --test integration issue_349_reverse_sort_follow_up_must_not_be_unknown -- --ignored` reproduced the issue: turn 5 kept the ascending list-files program. The test is now active and passes without `--ignored`.\n\n## Tests\n- `cargo fmt --check`\n- `cargo clippy --all-targets --all-features`\n- `cargo test`\n- `cargo test program_plan -- --nocapture`\n- `cargo test operation_vocabulary -- --nocapture`\n- `cargo test explicit_list_files_reverse_sort_modifiers_compose -- --nocapture`\n- `cargo test explicit_reverse_sort_path_argument_programs_work_in_every_supported_prompt_language -- --nocapture`\n- `cargo test --test integration issue_349_reverse_sort_follow_up_must_not_be_unknown -- --nocapture`\n- `npm run --prefix tests/e2e check:language-test-coverage`\n- `node --check src/web/formal_ai_worker.js`\n- `node --check experiments/issue-324-js-worker.mjs`\n- `node experiments/issue-324-js-worker.mjs`\n- `rust-script scripts/check-file-size.rs` (passes with existing near-limit warnings)\n- `GITHUB_BASE_REF=main rust-script scripts/check-changelog-fragment.rs`\n- `GITHUB_EVENT_NAME=pull_request GITHUB_HEAD_REF=issue-358-4e868b49d9a1 GITHUB_BASE_REF=main rust-script scripts/check-version-modification.rs`\n- `GITHUB_EVENT_NAME=pull_request rust-script scripts/detect-code-changes.rs`","headRefName":"issue-358-4e868b49d9a1","headR
